# Tags and the works state in the item form: the item list's Works
# column; Condition stepped to empty (not graded) with Space, then to NEW
# and cleared with Ctrl-Y; Status and Works, both required, stepped
# round to where they began; the tag pick list while no item has tags;
# tags typed and saved, shown as the server keeps them; the pick list of
# those tags, one appended to another item's tags, and one refused for
# want of room.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
S LIST
K CTRL-E
S FORM
K TAB TAB TAB SPACE SPACE SPACE
S NOGRADE
K SPACE
S CONDNEW
K CTRL-Y
S CLEARED
K STAB STAB SPACE SPACE
S STATUSA
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB SPACE SPACE SPACE SPACE
S WORKSY
K PGDN UP F4
S NOTAGS
T Retro, ISA  retro,,pci
K CTRL-S ENTER
S SAVED
K ESC DOWN CTRL-E PGDN UP F4
S PICK
K END ENTER
S ADDED
K CTRL-Y
T aaaaaaaaaaa bbbbbbbbbbb ccccccccccc ddddddddddd eeeeeeeee
K F4 ENTER
S NOROOM
K ESC
T Y
K ESC
K F3
T Y
